1029 0 obj
<<
/Title (The technical challenge addressed by DisasterGuard AI centers on feature warping and geometric distortion resulting from non-square webcam telemetry \(16:9\) being force-resized into fixed 150x150 convolutional kernels, which induces a systematic misclassification bias, particularly horizontal artifact skewing toward Water Disaster. Our solution implements a high-concurrency FastAPI inference pipeline that utilizes a dynamic center-cropping algorithm to isolate square ROIs \(Regions of Interest\) before passing the float32-normalized pixel arrays into a Sequential CNN engine. This architecture produces a 6-node Softmax probability distribution, which is processed through an asynchronous feedback API to log prediction telemetry and cross-verify actual vs. predicted labels, ensuring high-fidelity situational awareness while eliminating feature distortion at the preprocessing layer)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 843 0 R
>>
endobj
